OL,3,AStudents across England, Wales and
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland receive their GCSE and
OL,5,ABTec results
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn 2025, the GCSE pass rate in England
OL,8,Ffell for the fourth year running, to
OL,9,F67.4% - national data for this year is
OL,10,Fexpected later this morning
OL,12,FIn England, GCSEs are graded using a
OL,13,Fnumerical system from 9-1, while in
OL,14,FWales and Northern Ireland they are
OL,15,Fstill graded using letters from A* to U
OL,17,FStudents in Scotland have already
OL,18,Freceived their results, with the pass
OL,19,Frate up slightly on last year
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
